Output media/install.gif

Require npx

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 440
Set Padding 28
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"

Hide
Type "export THREADNAUTS_DATA_DIR=/tmp/threadnauts-demo && npx --yes @threadcrumbs/threadnauts --version && clear"
Enter
Sleep 20s
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "npx @threadcrumbs/threadnauts --no-open"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
